            "review_text": "dietris2017\nBuenos Aires, Argentina58 contributions\n0\nTerrible noise at midnight from their wokrers\nDec 2023 • Family\nThe restaurant is a source of noise and bad Karaoke. Given they don’t have any walls and no roof (just some plastic covers from rain and sun), this is terrible.\nDrunken people singing Karaoke until 10 in the evening. Then the cleaners start at MIDNIGHT with a device on their back. First they „spray or sweap“ the inside, then they do the same on the pavement. THIS IS NOT ACEPPTABLE for the neighbours living there and trying to get some sleep.\nAfterwards, now its already 1/1:30 hrs in the morning, the workers/guards etc. Take chairs and a table outside to the pavement and having great conversations you can hear in your bedroom.\nCan’t Management think of a time more suitable for the cleaning procedure than midnight? And also can’t they think of a better place for the workers to have a break or their meal or socialise than the streets pavement and keeping neighbours awake?\nPLEASE start to be more considerate, even it you not around in the middle of the night. River Garden will be greatful.\nRead more\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 17, 2024",
