            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6919 contributions\n3\na little pricey\nApr 2023\nOrdered a squid dish, a beef dish and a rice dish, all nice and tasty and very well presented and the accompanying sauces were nice.....all washed down with some beer. Good clean food that is well cooked.\nPlace is nice and relaxing, has a nice ambiance. \nBut it was a little pricey, coming at about 34 Euros, for in essence small portions for two, and was like a snack rather than a dinner......when we were really looking to be fed!\nService was friendly and efficient\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 4, 2023",
